// Kernel 1 publication reg = %r12.  Reduction is 4 iters unrolled into
// 4 compute+publish DBB pairs (DBB 3..10).  Split-DBB pattern avoids the
// intra-DBB %r12 publication race.
//
// SRF addr = neighbor_tid * 32 + 12.  Partner offsets (in addr units):
//   iter 1: +512   (neighbor_tid = my_tid + 16)
//   iter 2: +1024  (my_tid + 32)
//   iter 3: +2048  (my_tid + 64)
//   iter 4: +4096  (my_tid + 128)
